WEBVTT

00:27.360 --> 00:28.611
Fluff...

00:30.488 --> 00:33.490
♪ My life is full of surprises
I can't think of ♪

00:33.491 --> 00:36.410
♪ Though I can't say it's a good thing ♪

00:36.411 --> 00:38.746
♪ In this peaceful slow life ♪

00:38.747 --> 00:41.832
♪ Don't let anything bother you ♪

00:41.833 --> 00:44.501
♪ Just be yourself and go forward!♪

00:44.502 --> 00:49.540
(I've Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years
and Maxed Out My Level Season 2)

00:55.805 --> 00:58.557
♪ I jumped into the world
without contemplating ♪

00:58.558 --> 01:01.226
♪ Got myself a freewheeling,
self-indulging life ♪

01:01.227 --> 01:04.063
♪ Oh, how lucky I am to have it ♪

01:04.064 --> 01:06.273
♪ But I can't surely let my guard down ♪

01:06.274 --> 01:09.068
♪ One after the other,
they just keep coming ♪

01:09.069 --> 01:11.904
♪ Give me a break from
these random happenings ♪

01:11.905 --> 01:15.491
♪ However, but, I can't afford to lose here!♪

01:15.492 --> 01:17.743
♪ Since I maxed out my level!♪

01:17.744 --> 01:22.998
♪ I want to protect
my loved ones and our home ♪

01:22.999 --> 01:25.667
♪ Thus I can become stronger,
and overcome anything ♪

01:25.668 --> 01:27.961
♪ I'm dead serious!♪

01:27.962 --> 01:31.173
♪ My destiny is full of surprises
I can't think of ♪

01:31.174 --> 01:33.759
♪ Though I can't say it's a good thing ♪

01:33.760 --> 01:36.720
♪ In this life where we are together ♪

01:36.721 --> 01:39.348
♪ The fact alone is
enough to make us winners ♪

01:39.349 --> 01:42.017
♪ Even when the sun sets and rises again ♪

01:42.018 --> 01:44.728
♪ Always go all-out at any moment ♪

01:44.729 --> 01:47.439
♪ Don't forget to smile, cry, and eat a lot ♪

01:47.440 --> 01:50.275
♪ Don't let anything bother you ♪

01:50.276 --> 01:53.029
♪ Just enjoy yourself, so lucky!♪

02:02.080 --> 02:04.740
(I Went to the Demon King's
Birthday Party)

02:08.002 --> 02:09.003
Up you go.

02:14.759 --> 02:16.426
Nice, nice!

02:16.427 --> 02:17.761
This feels good!

02:17.762 --> 02:19.471
How convenient.

02:19.472 --> 02:22.099
If you can drink from
both your feet and mouth,

02:22.100 --> 02:24.685
you can drink booze
twice the amount!

02:24.686 --> 02:26.771
Don't give her weird ideas.

02:28.189 --> 02:30.149
Oh, it's out of water.

02:30.150 --> 02:31.692
I'll go fill it up.

02:31.693 --> 02:34.154
I still haven't had enough.
Hurry up.

02:39.159 --> 02:41.286
Sister!

02:42.537 --> 02:44.705
Pecora! Get off me!

02:44.706 --> 02:46.790
Oh, but why?

02:46.791 --> 02:51.044
Geez, is the Demon King even allowed
to hang around here nonchalantly?

02:51.045 --> 02:54.339
Your little sister is
simply here to see you!

02:54.340 --> 02:55.716
Get off me already!

02:55.717 --> 02:57.552
Oh, come on!

02:58.303 --> 03:00.053
What are you doing?

03:00.054 --> 03:03.056
Oh, my. Looks like the child is well.

03:03.057 --> 03:04.433
Who are you calling a child?!

03:04.434 --> 03:06.185
Raaaawrrr!

03:06.186 --> 03:10.190
I have just the perfect
childlike present for a child.

03:11.608 --> 03:13.650
Soil full of nutrition!

03:13.651 --> 03:15.445
That's so not childlike!

03:15.945 --> 03:18.906
Huh, so you do know me well...

03:18.907 --> 03:20.824
Let me try it.

03:20.825 --> 03:22.702
And she's happy with that?

03:23.119 --> 03:24.411
Miss Pecora!

03:24.412 --> 03:25.787
Hello!

03:25.788 --> 03:27.206
Welcome!

03:27.207 --> 03:30.543
I also brought presents for each of you!

03:32.462 --> 03:33.463
Let's see...

03:33.838 --> 03:36.965
I have a cursed ring for you,
Miss Rosalie.

03:36.966 --> 03:38.967
That thing looks violent!

03:38.968 --> 03:43.472
You assume I love this kind
of stuff because I'm a ghost...?

03:43.473 --> 03:44.848
As for you, Miss Laika,

03:44.849 --> 03:48.477
here's a magic item that can turn
any mountain into an active volcano!

03:48.478 --> 03:50.479
There's another violent item!

03:50.480 --> 03:53.232
Th-Thank you...

03:53.233 --> 03:56.652
Here's a charm that can
summon a blizzard, Miss Flatorte.

03:56.653 --> 03:59.738
Wow, I'll use it right away outside!

03:59.739 --> 04:00.989
No, don't!

04:00.990 --> 04:02.741
Don't you have anything non-violent?!

04:02.742 --> 04:05.869
For the twins, I have a couple of books
about the demons' natural science,

04:05.870 --> 04:08.372
and history, that you can
only find in the demons' library!

04:08.373 --> 04:10.250
Wow, thanks!

04:12.710 --> 04:14.461
This is a rare find...

04:14.462 --> 04:16.255
She's just plain happy...

04:16.256 --> 04:18.215
And for you, Miss Halkara,

04:18.216 --> 04:21.009
here's a title deed for a shop
in the land of the demons.

04:21.010 --> 04:24.638
Wow, you know me so well, Miss Pecora!

04:24.639 --> 04:27.809
An Energy Tonic factory
in the land of the demons...

04:29.394 --> 04:31.771
Up to no good again, aren't you...

04:32.855 --> 04:36.276
None of those items are so girlish.

04:36.651 --> 04:39.152
Finally, for your present...

04:39.153 --> 04:41.280
Here are some homemade cookies!

04:41.281 --> 04:43.532
Now that's a girlish item.

04:43.533 --> 04:44.992
Thanks.

04:44.993 --> 04:48.078
But, we can't just receive
all these and do nothing.

04:48.079 --> 04:49.913
We should pay you back in some way...

04:49.914 --> 04:54.668
You see, I'll be throwing
my birthday party soon!

04:54.669 --> 04:57.045
Oh, I see!

04:57.046 --> 04:59.047
Congratulations!

04:59.048 --> 05:03.051
I would like you to attend the party.

05:03.052 --> 05:05.220
Oh, so that's what's going on here?

05:05.221 --> 05:07.889
You didn't have to bring presents to us.

05:07.890 --> 05:08.807
We would've attended...

05:08.808 --> 05:11.935
However, I'm only inviting you alone.

05:11.936 --> 05:12.811
Huh?

05:12.812 --> 05:14.271
What?

05:14.272 --> 05:16.815
I mean, it's my birthday.

05:16.816 --> 05:22.196
I'd love to have you all
for myself on that day!

05:22.780 --> 05:25.198
Well, it's my little sister's birthday.

05:25.199 --> 05:28.076
If that's what you want,
then I'll grant it.

05:28.077 --> 05:30.037
Is that okay with you girls?

05:30.038 --> 05:30.662
Sure.

05:30.663 --> 05:32.956
Have fun out there!

05:32.957 --> 05:35.001
Thank you!

05:37.086 --> 05:39.589
(A Few Days Later)

05:40.882 --> 05:44.093
Wow... That's a crowd...

05:49.682 --> 05:52.726
O World, shine darkly and deeply

05:52.727 --> 05:56.688
With my love

05:56.689 --> 05:59.941
It's darkness time! There's always
darkness when there's no light!

05:59.942 --> 06:01.693
The demons' power is extra free!

06:01.694 --> 06:03.737
In this darkness, together

06:03.738 --> 06:06.573
Celebrate my birthday
with all your power, okay!

06:06.574 --> 06:08.700
Dead, dead, dead, dead

06:08.701 --> 06:12.621
Deadly hunting, magical miracle

06:12.622 --> 06:15.749
Yummy darkness is the source of wellness

06:15.750 --> 06:19.544
Surprising, shocking,
kill and spill it, oh!

06:19.545 --> 06:23.548
Demons reel in the chills and thrills
all around the hills

06:23.549 --> 06:25.300
So-cu-te-ly!

06:25.301 --> 06:28.303
Show them all a hell of a dream

06:28.304 --> 06:31.556
Nonstop through the whole year

06:31.557 --> 06:34.393
To have a crush on someone is so precious,

06:34.394 --> 06:36.728
pure, and scary, right?

06:36.729 --> 06:40.107
But, the heavier the feelings,
the more they weigh...

06:40.108 --> 06:41.983
One day, they will reach your loved one!

06:41.984 --> 06:45.195
The wind of demons will blow tomorrow,
carrying big darkness and love!

06:45.196 --> 06:49.658
Darkness is made of love and hope

06:49.659 --> 06:52.702
Root for me till the end of your life

06:52.703 --> 06:55.789
Enjoy even the verse coming from within

06:55.790 --> 06:57.958
Sing it with your heart

06:57.959 --> 07:01.878
I'll use my charm that can turn

07:01.879 --> 07:05.132
Skull symbols into hearts

07:05.133 --> 07:08.009
Until you cough blood

07:08.010 --> 07:14.391
Revere me to eternity!

07:14.392 --> 07:17.228
The cutest Demon King Pecora
steals the lightshow tonight!

07:27.488 --> 07:29.281
Good evening!

07:29.282 --> 07:32.617
I'm the Demon King,
Provato Pecora Ariés!

07:32.618 --> 07:37.581
Ladies and gentlemen,
welcome to my birthday party live stage!

07:37.582 --> 07:42.420
Happy birthday, Demon King!

07:43.463 --> 07:45.922
Such leadership...

07:45.923 --> 07:50.010
The next song will be a duo.

07:50.011 --> 07:53.930
My partner really wants
to celebrate my birthday with this.

07:53.931 --> 07:55.307
Duo?

07:55.308 --> 07:58.686
Someone who could
pair up with Pecora...

08:01.689 --> 08:02.940
What?!

08:04.192 --> 08:08.029
The title is,
"Love Triangle Dark Magic Circle!"

08:26.839 --> 08:28.716
So, what is this?

08:29.217 --> 08:31.426
It's the Demon King's birthday party,

08:31.427 --> 08:34.013
which also doubles as the
closing to her live stage.

08:35.723 --> 08:37.724
Beelzebub!

08:37.725 --> 08:39.935
That is not what you think, Azusa!

08:39.936 --> 08:41.895
I had turned her down many times!

08:41.896 --> 08:44.898
But, she insisted that
this was part of my job,

08:44.899 --> 08:47.734
and she even decided my costume
and choreography so arbitrarily!

08:47.735 --> 08:51.029
You will not tell
a living soul about this!

08:51.030 --> 08:52.989
Okay, okay, I get you.

08:52.990 --> 08:55.743
You were forced into this, right?

08:57.495 --> 08:59.746
I am glad you understand.

08:59.747 --> 09:02.999
But, you were so into it at the cafe,

09:03.000 --> 09:05.752
so I'd say you did a decent job today.

09:05.753 --> 09:07.754
No way!

09:07.755 --> 09:09.749
- How many times do it...
- Okay, Boss.

09:09.750 --> 09:09.756
- How many times do it...
- Okay, Boss.
- Let's say hello to the guests now, shall we?

09:09.757 --> 09:11.341
- Let's say hello to the guests now, shall we?

09:11.342 --> 09:12.509
- Let go!
- Let's say hello to the guests now, shall we?

09:12.510 --> 09:13.260
- Let's say hello to the guests now, shall we?

09:13.261 --> 09:14.261
Wait!

09:14.262 --> 09:17.640
I have not cleared things up
with Azusa yet!

09:30.570 --> 09:33.029
Thank you all for attending
my live performance,

09:33.030 --> 09:38.535
and also my birthday party
tonight, everyone.

09:38.536 --> 09:41.037
I'm sure you don't want
me to yap too much,

09:41.038 --> 09:43.039
so I'll make it short.

09:43.040 --> 09:46.334
Please, enjoy the closing party as well!

09:46.335 --> 09:47.419
That's all!

09:47.420 --> 09:49.045
Goodbye!

09:49.046 --> 09:51.047
That's it?!

09:51.048 --> 09:53.717
My, she concluded her
speech short again this year.

09:53.718 --> 09:58.055
The preceding Demon King's
speeches used to drag for so long.

09:59.098 --> 10:00.515
Guess I'll go back now.

10:00.516 --> 10:01.683
Miss Azusa.

10:01.684 --> 10:03.226
Fatla?

10:03.227 --> 10:05.270
How are you enjoying the party?

10:05.271 --> 10:07.939
Yeah, I'm having fun!

10:07.940 --> 10:11.026
It's a shame I can't celebrate
her birthday in person,

10:11.027 --> 10:13.194
but I guess the highlight character
of the day must be busy.

10:13.195 --> 10:16.197
Are you about to go home now?

10:16.198 --> 10:17.699
Eh...

10:17.700 --> 10:22.871
The Demon King has ordered me
to take you to the private dinner table.

10:22.872 --> 10:23.789
Huh?!

10:27.710 --> 10:29.670
I'll excuse myself, then.

10:34.091 --> 10:35.425
Oh, I get it...

10:35.426 --> 10:37.677
So, she wants to celebrate it
with me alone.

10:37.678 --> 10:39.220
That's the idea!

10:39.221 --> 10:42.974
The party won't start unless
you celebrate it in person!

10:42.975 --> 10:45.477
The ceremony is just a bonus!

10:45.478 --> 10:47.604
Bo-nus.

10:47.605 --> 10:48.730
Slurp...

10:48.731 --> 10:50.482
Slurp?

10:50.483 --> 10:53.526
Whoops, I almost lost myself there.

10:53.527 --> 10:56.489
Well, that's what I came here for.

11:00.326 --> 11:02.995
I'll celebrate it wholeheartedly for you.

11:03.579 --> 11:06.247
Happy birthday, Pecora.

11:06.248 --> 11:09.502
Thank you, Dear Sister!

11:15.007 --> 11:17.510
That's the Demon King's dinner for you!

11:18.219 --> 11:19.886
Since it's your birthday,

11:19.887 --> 11:22.514
I'll grant you anything
you wish for, if you like.

11:22.515 --> 11:26.059
You don't have to worry about it.

11:26.060 --> 11:32.650
All I want is to celebrate my birthday
alone with you, and that'll be enough.

11:35.152 --> 11:38.279
That much is a piece of cake!

11:38.280 --> 11:40.156
I'll humor you just for today.

11:40.157 --> 11:41.908
Just for today?

11:41.909 --> 11:44.828
But, your birthday is only today...

11:44.829 --> 11:47.372
How about five days?

11:47.373 --> 11:52.419
I think I can do five days if
I tell the folks at home first...

11:52.420 --> 11:54.129
You're okay with it?

11:54.130 --> 11:55.547
I'm so happy!

11:55.548 --> 11:58.425
Miss Vania, bring us the main dish!

11:58.426 --> 12:00.428
Right away!

12:01.303 --> 12:03.471
Eat up now!

12:03.472 --> 12:06.933
The finest meat from
our kitchen just for you,

12:06.934 --> 12:09.811
served with a selection of mushrooms.

12:09.812 --> 12:11.439
Wow!

12:24.076 --> 12:26.369
This is so good!

12:26.370 --> 12:30.082
The meat and mushrooms are so soft,
they're melting in my mouth!

12:31.917 --> 12:36.045
Sister, please listen to me as you eat.

12:36.046 --> 12:38.339
Hm? What's that, all of a sudden?

12:38.340 --> 12:43.094
Actually, I have a wish for my birthday.

12:43.095 --> 12:46.681
Wow, even the Demon King
can make a wish too, huh?

12:46.682 --> 12:50.101
But, I haven't been able to obtain it...

12:50.102 --> 12:53.605
However, I'm about to soon.

12:53.606 --> 12:56.025
Good for you...

12:57.109 --> 12:59.027
What the...

12:59.028 --> 13:00.362
My body feels itchy...

13:01.614 --> 13:05.618
Allow me to tell you my wish...

13:10.372 --> 13:13.082
It's to have a big sister I can snuggle!

13:13.083 --> 13:14.501
What?!

13:14.502 --> 13:18.005
(I've Been Killing Slimes for 300 Years
and Maxed Out My Level Season 2)

13:21.509 --> 13:22.759
Oh, egad! What the heck?!

13:22.760 --> 13:25.011
What are these weird ears and tail?!

13:25.012 --> 13:26.846
My, oh, my!

13:26.847 --> 13:29.516
Sister, you look so cute!

13:29.517 --> 13:31.518
Is this the mushrooms' doing?!

13:31.519 --> 13:32.227
Yes.

13:32.228 --> 13:34.270
It's called turn-into-a-fox mushrooms.

13:34.271 --> 13:35.647
She got me!

13:35.648 --> 13:38.066
I let my guard down because
she said she wanted

13:38.067 --> 13:40.276
to spend time together
with me so gallantly!

13:40.277 --> 13:43.571
With the amount you ate...

13:43.572 --> 13:46.199
I think you'll be back
to normal after five days.

13:46.200 --> 13:47.492
Not a problem, is it?

13:47.493 --> 13:50.787
You'll be with me for
five days exactly, after all.

13:50.788 --> 13:52.038
Wha...

13:52.039 --> 13:54.708
Or, perhaps you're planning
to go home looking like that?

13:56.210 --> 13:58.378
Wh-What's up with those ears?

13:58.379 --> 14:00.547
You look so cute, Lady Azusa!

14:00.548 --> 14:01.714
You have a tail!

14:01.715 --> 14:03.925
Just like yours truly!

14:03.926 --> 14:06.886
Wow, Mama's a fox!

14:06.887 --> 14:09.305
Allow me to observe you closely.

14:09.306 --> 14:11.391
Those surprisingly look good on you.

14:11.392 --> 14:15.061
So, you're into
this kind of thing, Master?

14:15.062 --> 14:17.398
Curse you, Demon King...

14:18.399 --> 14:20.608
You two are complicit in this too, huh?!

14:20.609 --> 14:23.319
It's the Demon King's order...

14:23.320 --> 14:26.322
You look good...
with those ears...

14:26.323 --> 14:28.408
If you're going to laugh,
then do it properly!

14:28.409 --> 14:31.536
Also, don't you dare tell Beelzebub!

14:31.537 --> 14:34.205
All right, my fox beast sister.

14:34.206 --> 14:36.709
Shall we go to bed now?

14:37.209 --> 14:41.588
Let's brush your tail first,
and it's snuggly time for me!

14:41.589 --> 14:43.716
Have it your way, then...

14:47.636 --> 14:50.513
Wow... Sister...

14:50.514 --> 14:53.725
What nice fur...

14:53.726 --> 14:56.019
Don't be too rough, okay?

14:56.020 --> 14:57.478
Of course.

14:57.479 --> 14:59.522
Fluff, fluff...

14:59.523 --> 15:02.692
Hey, don't drool on my tail, okay?

15:02.693 --> 15:05.069
I don't really consider this
my own tail, though,

15:05.070 --> 15:06.279
but I'll still hate it.

15:06.280 --> 15:10.116
I'll sleep while hugging
this fluffy tail tonight...

15:10.117 --> 15:11.200
Fluff, fluff...

15:11.201 --> 15:13.787
Still, a fox beast, huh...

15:14.288 --> 15:18.416
I got so sleepy when my body
got shrunken by a mushroom,

15:18.417 --> 15:21.294
but is there more to this than
a change in appearance?

15:21.295 --> 15:24.005
Truth is, we haven't had
many reports of people

15:24.006 --> 15:26.799
turning into fox beasts
after eating the mushroom,

15:26.800 --> 15:29.052
so I don't know the details.

15:29.053 --> 15:32.055
Don't feed me something like that, then.

15:32.056 --> 15:34.183
But, well...

15:35.517 --> 15:36.935
What is this?

15:36.936 --> 15:39.562
My instincts are craving something...

15:39.563 --> 15:40.688
What is this...

15:40.689 --> 15:43.817
It's square and greasy...

15:45.819 --> 15:47.071
Sister?

15:47.571 --> 15:49.573
I want abura-age!

15:50.908 --> 15:53.201
Aburahge? What's that?

15:53.202 --> 15:54.202
Abura-age!

15:54.203 --> 15:56.329
Bring me abura-age as an offering!

15:56.330 --> 15:59.958
I wouldn't know what it is
unless you tell me.

15:59.959 --> 16:03.962
Also, an offering?
But a fox isn't a god.

16:03.963 --> 16:07.006
The tofu vendor should be selling that!

16:07.007 --> 16:08.383
Inari sushi will do, too!

16:08.384 --> 16:12.136
I don't know anything about
this tohfu or inaree sooshee too...

16:12.137 --> 16:14.389
Calm down, Sister.

16:14.390 --> 16:17.016
I bet it's the effect of being a fox,

16:17.017 --> 16:20.019
but I can't control it!

16:20.020 --> 16:22.397
Abura-age!

16:22.398 --> 16:23.898
Sister?!

16:23.899 --> 16:24.983
Sorry, Pecora!

16:24.984 --> 16:27.569
I'll go look for abura-age!

16:28.779 --> 16:31.280
Oh, my...

16:31.281 --> 16:33.783
Abura-age! Abura-age!

16:33.784 --> 16:36.536
My body's moving on its own!

16:36.537 --> 16:38.539
This is troublesome!

16:38.956 --> 16:40.123
Sniff, sniff...

16:40.124 --> 16:41.958
I smell food!

16:41.959 --> 16:44.545
Must be the kitchen!

16:45.546 --> 16:46.462
Vania!

16:46.463 --> 16:47.797
Eep!

16:47.798 --> 16:50.800
W-What are you doing here?

16:50.801 --> 16:52.552
Give me abura-age!

16:52.553 --> 16:54.429
Aburahge?

16:54.430 --> 16:56.556
Where does that food come from?

16:56.557 --> 16:59.058
My body craves abura-age!

16:59.059 --> 17:02.228
I mean, it's because of
my appearance, okay?

17:02.229 --> 17:04.814
I can't control it...

17:04.815 --> 17:06.066
Abura-age!

17:06.608 --> 17:09.736
I can see that you're in trouble.

17:09.737 --> 17:12.405
A luxurious ingredient like
the turn-into-a-fox mushroom...

17:12.406 --> 17:14.991
...isn't something to be eaten that many.

17:14.992 --> 17:18.327
It must have caused
your temporary excitement.

17:18.328 --> 17:21.330
I'm telling you,
don't feed me that!

17:21.331 --> 17:23.249
- Where's the abura-age?!

17:23.250 --> 17:25.001
- It'll die down after a while!
- Where's the abura-age?!

17:25.002 --> 17:26.330
- It'll die down after a while!

17:26.837 --> 17:28.880
Hey, you got any abura-age?!

17:28.881 --> 17:29.840
Huh?

17:33.594 --> 17:35.219
You got any abura-age?!

17:35.220 --> 17:36.597
What's that?

17:37.306 --> 17:39.098
Where's the abura-age?!

17:39.099 --> 17:40.016
What?

17:40.017 --> 17:41.100
Who goes there?!

17:41.101 --> 17:43.436
We have an intruder fox beast!

17:43.437 --> 17:45.772
She's scrambling about the palace,
demanding aburahge!

17:45.773 --> 17:47.482
What's even an aburahge?!

17:47.483 --> 17:49.108
Someone get her!

17:49.109 --> 17:51.611
Abura-age!

17:51.612 --> 17:55.990
So, you're the intruding fox beast...

17:55.991 --> 18:00.620
I am one of the Four Heavenly Kings
of Vanzeld Castle, Cervin!

18:00.621 --> 18:02.997
If you surrender now...

18:02.998 --> 18:03.749
(Ka-pow!)
Ka-pow!

18:06.001 --> 18:08.503
Abura-age!

18:08.504 --> 18:10.880
One of the Four Heavenly Kings,
Cervin, is knocked out!

18:10.881 --> 18:13.007
The enemy is strong!
On your guard!

18:13.008 --> 18:15.009
What do we do to stop her?!

18:15.010 --> 18:17.261
We just have to give her aburahge!

18:17.262 --> 18:19.764
Abura-age! Abura-age!

18:19.765 --> 18:22.683
Sorry! I can't stop myself!

18:22.684 --> 18:25.269
What a menace you are.

18:25.270 --> 18:28.272
I must present it to you, then.

18:28.273 --> 18:31.275
You have abura-age?!

18:31.276 --> 18:32.860
Very well.

18:32.861 --> 18:35.948
It is time to break the seal.

18:36.615 --> 18:40.451
Unleash the demon beast
once sealed in the basement!

18:40.452 --> 18:44.289
Ah Burange!

18:47.668 --> 18:50.044
Abura-age!

18:50.045 --> 18:52.255
The legendary demon beast is down!

18:52.256 --> 18:53.798
What should we do?!

18:53.799 --> 18:55.007
Abura-age!

18:55.008 --> 18:56.300
Kyaaah!

18:56.301 --> 18:57.802
The second Four Heavenly King!

18:57.803 --> 18:58.970
Abura-age!

18:58.971 --> 18:59.971
Awww!

18:59.972 --> 19:01.806
N-Not the third too?!

19:01.807 --> 19:03.724
Abura-age!

19:03.725 --> 19:06.227
All the Four Heavenly Kings are down!

19:06.228 --> 19:09.313
Abura-age!

19:09.314 --> 19:12.733
Where's the abura-age?!

19:12.734 --> 19:14.318
Stop it right there!

19:14.319 --> 19:15.319
Huh?

19:15.320 --> 19:17.822
You fox beast.

19:17.823 --> 19:23.578
I do not know who you might be,
but you have really made quite a mess.

19:23.579 --> 19:25.830
It is time to end this.

19:25.831 --> 19:29.167
You're the last person
I want to see me like this...

19:29.168 --> 19:30.960
I do not know who you might be...

19:30.961 --> 19:32.378
It's not my fault!

19:32.379 --> 19:34.463
It's your people's doing!

19:34.464 --> 19:37.426
I can't stop it! Abura-age!

19:40.929 --> 19:43.556
I have already learned your moves.

19:43.557 --> 19:45.516
I can restrain you momentarily.

19:45.517 --> 19:46.435
Fatla!

20:05.329 --> 20:06.829
This is the stuff!

20:06.830 --> 20:09.208
I've been craving this!

20:10.459 --> 20:12.001
Good grief...

20:12.002 --> 20:13.961
They had abura-age here...

20:13.962 --> 20:15.713
I do not know about any aburahge.

20:15.714 --> 20:19.258
It is a processed bean
food that the elves eat.

20:19.259 --> 20:21.636
They call it biranwa.

20:21.637 --> 20:24.805
I asked the fox beasts
in the castle town,

20:24.806 --> 20:26.725
and they said it's their favorite food.

20:27.809 --> 20:32.481
Wow... Look at the damage done here.

20:34.441 --> 20:37.443
Do not "wow" me, Milord!

20:37.444 --> 20:39.528
The building is terribly damaged!

20:39.529 --> 20:41.989
Not to mention, all the Four Heavenly
Kings are knocked out,

20:41.990 --> 20:43.950
making them lose confidence!

20:43.951 --> 20:48.329
So, we could find out there's a problem
with the defense system.

20:48.330 --> 20:50.206
All's well that ends well, isn't it?

20:50.207 --> 20:51.958
Milord!

20:51.959 --> 20:55.211
I'm sorry...
I went too far...

20:55.212 --> 20:57.339
The Demon King is getting scolded.

20:57.673 --> 20:59.590
Also, Azusa!

20:59.591 --> 21:02.469
I'm getting scolded too...

21:03.262 --> 21:05.472
Well, uh...

21:08.517 --> 21:12.061
You... look rather cute.

21:12.062 --> 21:13.480
Huh?

21:14.982 --> 21:15.982
Shortly after...

21:15.983 --> 21:19.735
Until I got back to normal, the number
of people snuggling my tail for days...

21:19.736 --> 21:24.991
...went from only one to four, with
Beelzebub, Fatla, and Vania joining in.

21:24.992 --> 21:29.370
Sister, you're so fluffy...

21:29.371 --> 21:31.289
Nice...

21:31.290 --> 21:35.002
My stress is dissipating...

21:35.585 --> 21:36.378
Huff...

21:51.560 --> 21:55.731
♪ Even when I've carefully
written a schedule ♪

21:56.940 --> 22:02.486
♪ I could still throw it away on a whim
because I don't feel like doing it ♪

22:02.487 --> 22:06.657
♪ Unless it's an important appointment ♪

22:06.658 --> 22:09.869
♪ Sometimes going about randomly ♪

22:09.870 --> 22:12.580
♪ Suits me well ♪

22:12.581 --> 22:17.418
♪ As ever, every day ♪

22:17.419 --> 22:20.588
♪ Is always followed by a flurry of events ♪

22:20.589 --> 22:27.345
♪ This and that, so many unpredictable
things, never a dull moment!♪

22:27.346 --> 22:31.098
♪ Now, one, two, and three!♪

22:31.099 --> 22:34.685
♪ Which one should I choose today?♪

22:34.686 --> 22:37.980
♪ All according to my wish ♪

22:37.981 --> 22:41.650
♪ I will take a step ♪

22:41.651 --> 22:47.031
♪ Sometimes losing my way,
brand new day ♪

22:47.032 --> 22:50.618
♪ What was it that made you shiver?♪

22:50.619 --> 22:52.578
♪ Makes you wonder what ♪

22:52.579 --> 22:54.080
♪ So let's go find out ♪

22:54.081 --> 22:56.248
♪ Slowly step glory days ♪

22:56.249 --> 22:59.377
♪ So I'm fine today and tomorrow ♪

22:59.378 --> 23:02.046
♪ Let's go out for the weekend ♪

23:02.047 --> 23:04.800
♪ Eeny meeny miny moe ♪

23:10.347 --> 23:12.473
(Life on the Highlands)
Life on the Highlands!

23:12.474 --> 23:15.726
Having a big sister I can
snuggle is the best!

23:15.727 --> 23:17.979
Fluff, fluff...

23:18.480 --> 23:19.981
Fluff, fluff, fluff, fluff!

23:20.357 --> 23:22.858
Pecora, your eyes are scaring me!

23:22.859 --> 23:24.860
(Part 2)
Part 2.

23:24.861 --> 23:27.864
Next up, we have a special guest on stage!

23:28.115 --> 23:30.492
Miss Kuku the bard!

23:31.660 --> 23:33.744
Please, listen to my song.

23:33.745 --> 23:37.499
Dark Doll Groggy Nightmare!

23:37.620 --> 23:37.998
(Screech)

23:37.999 --> 23:39.500
(Screech)
She's singing that song?!

23:39.501 --> 23:40.000
(Screech)
